These four packages are quite different from one another. They aren't simply four outdated packages that need their versions updated.

They represent four separate capabilities within your ecosystem:
1. Architectural Intelligence — domain knowledge and architectural operations for AgentSam.
2. PrimeTech Procedures — specialist workflows and operating procedures for PrimeTech.
3. Theme Contract — the shared technical contract that makes independently developed themes compatible with the CMS.
4. IAMScene — a reusable 3D scene and spatial application capability.
The distinction matters because each has a different purpose, audience, dependency structure and distribution strategy.

Here's what each actually does and where I would position it.
1. Architectural Intelligence
Private
